-xs text-muted-foreground"><p><strong class="text-foreground">Corrective action:</strong> Update the source design file (<code>hardware/main.kicad_sch</code>) in your CAD tool to resolve bom.missing-mpn.</p><p class="mt-1"><small>Rerun required to verify: Push updated commit to trigger re-analysis in GitHub Actions.</small></p></div></li></ul></section></div></div><div class="mt-4"></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="mt-auto border-t border-border px-6 py-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><p>BoardReadyOps checks whether a board is ready to fabricate. Your repository and its full workflow logs stay the source of truth.</p></footer></div></div>",
